<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-flower">ðŸŒ»</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">To my favourite human</div>
  <h1>Happy<br>Birthday,<br><em>Sarthi.</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-desc">If I could give you one thing today, it would be the ability to see yourself the way the people who love you see you.</p>
  <div class="hero-date">Your day. Your light. Your story.</div>
  <a class="scroll-hint" href="http://dCVwmrBTxsvGpoc:HNEzGOgwgZG6Ee7@localhost:41958/storage/emulated/0/om/index.html#letter">THERE'S SOMETHING I WANT TO SAY<span>â†“</span></a>
</section>

<section class="section reveal-on-scroll visible" id="letter">
  <div class="section-label">01 â€” A letter for you</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Not just another<br><em>birthday wish.</em></h2>
  <div class="letter">
    <p>Dear Sarthi,</p>
    <p>Happy birthday to someone who deserves more happiness than a single day could ever hold.</p>
    <p>I don't know if I say it enough, but I'm genuinely glad our paths crossed. Life has a funny way of bringing certain people into our story, and somehow, they end up becoming a part of the moments we remember.</p>
    <p>I hope this new chapter is gentle with you. I hope you find reasons to laugh on the days that feel heavy, courage when things get difficult, and people who appreciate the little things that make you who you are.</p>
    <p>And whenever you start doubting yourself, please remember that you don't have to be perfect to be important. You don't have to make everyone happy to be worthy of love. Just being you is enough.</p>
    <p>You remind me of a sunflower in a quiet field: beautiful in your own way, still growing, still reaching for the light, even after cloudy days.</p>
    <p>I can't promise that every day will be amazing. But I can wish you a life filled with genuine smiles, unforgettable memories, and the kind of happiness that stays long after the celebrations end.</p>
    <p>Today, I hope you feel special. Not because it's your birthday, but because you are someone worth celebrating.</p>
    <p>Keep being you, Sarthi. Keep growing. Keep smiling. And never let the world convince you that your light isn't enough.</p>
    <p>Once again, happy birthday. May life give you a thousand beautiful reasons to smile. ðŸŒ»</p>
    <div class="letter-sign">â€” Om â™¡</div>
  </div>
</section>

