<section class="section reveal-on-scroll visible" id="secrets">
  <div class="section-label">03 â€” Open when you need it</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">A few little things<br><em>just for you.</em></h2>
  <p class="body-copy">Tap each message. You never know which one you might need on a random day.</p>

  <div class="memory-list">
    <button class="memory" aria-expanded="false">
      <span class="memory-icon">ðŸŒ§ï¸</span>
      <span class="memory-text">
        <span class="memory-title">Open when you're sad</span>
        <span class="memory-sub">For the days when smiling feels difficult.</span>
        <span class="memory-answer">Hey, Sarthi. You don't have to pretend to be okay all the time. Take a breath, give yourself a little kindness, and remember that one difficult day doesn't define your whole story. You are allowed to rest. ðŸŒ»</span>
      </span><span class="memory-plus">+</span>
    </button>

    <button class="memory" aria-expanded="false">
      <span class="memory-icon">ðŸŒ™</span>
      <span class="memory-text">
        <span class="memory-title">Open when you overthink</span>
        <span class="memory-sub">A little reminder to be gentle with yourself.</span>
        <span class="memory-answer">Not every unanswered question needs an answer tonight. Not every little mistake needs to become a big story in your head. You've made it through so many moments you once worried about. Trust yourself a little more. One step at a time, okay? ðŸ¤</span>
      </span><span class="memory-plus">+</span>
    </button>

    <button class="memory" aria-expanded="false">
      <span class="memory-icon">âœ¨</span>
      <span class="memory-text">
        <span class="memory-title">Open when you forget your worth</span>
        <span class="memory-sub">Read this one slowly.</span>
        <span class="memory-answer">You are not measured by your marks, your appearance, your mistakes, or somebody else's opinion of you. There is more to you than what you see on your worst day. You deserve respect, happiness, and a chance to become everything you dream of being. Never forget that, Sarthi. ðŸ’›</span>
      </span><span class="memory-plus">+</span>
    </button>

    <button class="memory" aria-expanded="false">
      <span class="memory-icon">ðŸŒ»</span>
      <span class="memory-text">
        <span class="memory-title">Open just because</span>
        <span class="memory-sub">No special reason. Just a little love.</span>
        <span class="memory-answer">Surprise! There doesn't need to be a reason to remind someone that they matter. So here's yours: I'm glad you're here, I'm glad our stories crossed, and I hope today gives you at least one memory that makes you smile whenever you think of it. â€” Om â™¡</span>
      </span><span class="memory-plus">+</span>
    </button>
