</section>

<section class="promise reveal-on-scroll">
  <div class="hero-flower">ðŸŒ»</div>
  <div class="section-label">04 â€” One last thing</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Keep turning<br><em>toward the light.</em></h2>
  <p class="body-copy">Sunflowers don't bloom overnight. Neither do people. Give yourself time, celebrate your small victories, and remember that even the slowest growth is still growth. You have so many beautiful chapters ahead of you, Sarthi.</p>

  <div class="final-card">
    <div class="sun">â˜€ï¸</div>
    <h3>Before you go...</h3>
    <p>There's one more little surprise.<br>And yes, it's especially for you.</p>
    <button class="gold-btn" id="lastSurprise">ONE LAST SURPRISE âœ¦</button>
    <div id="lastMessage" style="display:none;margin-top:25px">
      <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px">ðŸŒ»ðŸ’›</div>
      <h3 style="color:var(--gold)">You made it to the end!</h3>
      <p>If you've read all the way here, I hope you know how much thought went into this little page. It's not a grand gift, but it's something I made with care, just for you.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:18px;color:var(--cream)">Happy Birthday, Sarthi.<br>Keep shining, always.</p>
      <div class="letter-sign">â€” Om</div>
    </div>
